{"id":"steam-762250","steam":762250,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Fire In The Hole","summary":"This is an online shooting game with Battle Royale mode. The game is played in a dark room, you can switch on the rifle flashlight for illuminating targeted areas, but always watch out for enemies who follow the light to sneak up on you!","about":"This is an online shooting game with Battle Royale mode. The game is played in a dark room in which characters are shrunk to the 1/10 of their original sizes. Hide next to tea table or sofa to launch a surprise attack, or simply dive from bookshelf top to shoot whoever below. Since most of the game areas are surrounded by darkness, you can switch on the rifle flashlight for illuminating targeted areas, but always watch out for enemies who follow the light to sneak up on you!\r\n\r\nThere are various game modes available:\r\n1) Single player Battle Royale\r\n2) Group Battle Royale\r\n3) Team fight training\r\n4) Challenge mode\r\n\r\nThe game is still in Early Access, please feel free to offer your suggestion to make our game better down the road.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762250/portrait.png?t=1534337445","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762250/header.jpg?t=1534337445","banner":null,"header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762250/header.jpg?t=1534337445","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762250/ss_a1981a683a0044cc5e40a976440454753f0972a3.600x338.jpg?t=1534337445","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762250/ss_a1981a683a0044cc5e40a976440454753f0972a3.jpg?t=1534337445"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762250/ss_f41d3eaf04aec5b5c9b9db6373537ab0f2f4ec93.600x338.jpg?t=1534337445","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as